    1	"""
    2	Thread 11 / Slot 1 — bounded-direction line cover (numpy).
    3	
    4	For large N (e.g. 10^6), the all-pairs O(pi(N)^2) line enumeration is
    5	infeasible in pure Python. This script restricts the line search to
    6	canonical directions (a, b) with gcd(|a|,|b|)=1 and max(|a|,|b|) <= K_max.
    7	Each such direction defines a partition of the primes into lines (by
